  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stop online sexual exploitation and trafficking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Free a Girl fights sexual exploitation of children (SEC). We have rescued over 6000 minor girls since 2008 and are now fighting part of that battle online. The use of social media platforms to lure, sell and exploit minor children is growing and must be stopped immediately. Our Smart Rescue Project develops software that makes tracking down exploiters online easier. The software will be used by local partners who will analyze the data to locate and rescue girls from SEC.</narrative>
  </description>
